@startuml
actor Registrante
participant "registrar-usuario" as F
participant "Auth admin" as A
participant "Trigger perfil" as T
database "perfis Postgres" as P
participant "Storage" as S
Registrante -> F : POST cadastro + PDF
note right of F
PR #3 bloqueia tipo ADMIN no cadastro publico,
antes de criar Auth; continua pendente
corrigir trigger SQL com metadata editavel.
end note
F -> A : createUser(metadata)
A -> T : after auth.users insert
T -> P : INSERT perfis
F -> S : upload documentos-verificacao
alt upload falha
S --> F : error
F --> Registrante : 400 (Auth pode permanecer)
else upload OK
F --> Registrante : 201 usuarioId
end
@enduml
